config BR2_PACKAGE_LED_OPCUA_SERVER
	bool "led-opcua-server"
	help
	  Industrial OPC UA Binary Server (opc.tcp port 4840) and Part 14 UADP
	  PubSub publisher (UDP port 4841) that exposes the DE10-Nano FPGA LED
	  PIO peripheral as a browsable, self-describing OPC UA Address Space.

	  Phase 11 (17_opcua_hps_led) — Industrial IIoT with OPC UA.
